{"key": "[\"Muhammad bin Tughluq sends Delhi's officials, scholars and Sufis a thousand kilometres south, to Devagiri, renamed Daulatabad. Barani writes that not a cat or a dog was left in Delhi. Historians take that as rhetoric. By about 1335 the court is back. Many stay, and their families will help rule the next Deccan kingdom.\", \"sarvam:varun_en_suspense@en-IN\", \"+6%\", \"+0Hz\", {}, \"fx5\"]", "mp3": "/Users/saidevdhal/Desktop/Codes/indianepics/public/audio/en/daulatabad-1327.mp3", "duration": 22.306375, "words": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "Muhammad"}, {"t": 0.41308101851851853, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "bin"}, {"t": 0.8261620370370371, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "Tughluq"}, {"t": 1.2392430555555556, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "sends"}, {"t": 1.6523240740740741, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "Delhi's"}, {"t": 2.0654050925925924, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "officials,"}, {"t": 2.478486111111111, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "scholars"}, {"t": 2.89156712962963, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "and"}, {"t": 3.3046481481481482, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "Sufis"}, {"t": 3.7177291666666665, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "a"}, {"t": 4.130810185185185, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "thousand"}, {"t": 4.543891203703704, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "kilometres"}, {"t": 4.956972222222222, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "south,"}, {"t": 5.370053240740741, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "to"}, {"t": 5.78313425925926, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "Devagiri,"}, {"t": 6.196215277777778, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "renamed"}, {"t": 6.6092962962962964, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "Daulatabad."}, {"t": 7.022377314814815, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "Barani"}, {"t": 7.435458333333333, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "writes"}, {"t": 7.848539351851852, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "that"}, {"t": 8.26162037037037, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "not"}, {"t": 8.67470138888889, "d": 0.41308101851851853, "w": "a"}, {"t": 9.